I got my MS-DOS Nethack executable from linc.cis.upenn.edu, and in order 
for me to get into wizard mode, I have to type nethack -u Wizard -w -D.
That isn't what the Wheaton spoiler says to do, but if I do anything less,
I just find myself in Discover mode.  Then, I'm able to get the unlimited
wishes by hitting control-w, not alt-w or anything else.  It's a lot of fun,
but now I know how the whole game works, now....Very sad. 
Well, that's my two bits. Good Hacking!
